+/* Private heap for wined3d — avoids ntdll process heap fragmentation from
+ * high-frequency alloc/free cycles (GL buffer structs, staging buffers).
+ * Created at DLL_PROCESS_ATTACH, destroyed at DLL_PROCESS_DETACH. */
